# =============================================================================
# eatfear macro data sources
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the keys you have.
# Restart the dev server after changing.
# =============================================================================

# FRED (Federal Reserve Economic Data) — free, register at:
#   https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html
# Unlocks ~30 high-priority US macro indicators:
#   - Fed Funds Rate, 2/3M/5Y/10Y/30Y Treasury yields, 10Y TIPS
#   - 10Y-2Y / 10Y-3M curve spreads, HY / IG credit spreads
#   - CPI, Core CPI, PCE, Core PCE, PPI
#   - Unemployment, NFP, JOLTS, Initial Claims, Avg Hourly Earnings
#   - Fed balance sheet, Bank reserves, Reverse Repo, TGA, M1, M2
#   - Retail sales, Industrial production, Capacity utilization
#   - 30Y Mortgage rate, New home sales, Building permits
#   - Consumer Sentiment (UMich), 1Y inflation expectations
#
# Without this key, the macro dashboard falls back to ~50 Yahoo Finance series
# (still works, but US macro coverage is limited to what Yahoo exposes).
FRED_API_KEY=dd79f9d0e0768cc461fc553a2d571a93

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Crypto regime score (BTC multi-factor dashboard, /api/crypto/regime-score)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# CoinGlass Open API — required for ETF net flows & CEX balance change metrics.
# Dashboard: https://www.coinglass.com → Pricing / API Key. Header sent as CG-API-KEY.
COINGLASS_API_KEY=
#
# Override only when CoinGlass rotates host (default matches official docs).
# COINGLASS_BASE_URL=https://open-api-v4.coinglass.com
